stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FarmerSubmits: Farmer Submits<br/>Disease Report

    FarmerSubmits --> Pending: Report Stored<br/>in MongoDB<br/>Status: PENDING

    Pending --> OfficerNotified: 🔔 Push Notification<br/>Sent to Officer
    OfficerNotified --> OfficerReviews: Officer Dashboard<br/>Shows New Report

    OfficerReviews --> Decision: Officer Reviews<br/>Attached Image<br/>& Description

    Decision --> FalseReport: ❌ Not a Real Disease
    Decision --> ValidReport: ✅ Confirmed Disease
    Decision --> NeedMoreInfo: ❓ Needs Clarification

    FalseReport --> RejectedState: Status: REJECTED<br/>Farmer Notified
    ValidReport --> ApprovingState: Status: APPROVED

    NeedMoreInfo --> WaitingInfo: Status: WAITING<br/>Farmer Must<br/>Respond

    WaitingInfo --> Timeout{Wait 48 Hours?}
    Timeout -->|Yes| AutoReject: Auto-reject<br/>if no response
    Timeout -->|No| FarmerResponds: Farmer<br/>Provides<br/>More Info
    FarmerResponds --> Decision

    ApprovingState --> GeoCluster: Cluster Geographically<br/>Find Affected Area

    GeoCluster --> SeverityCalc: Calculate Severity<br/>Based on:<br/>- Spread Area<br/>- Weather<br/>- Crop Type

    SeverityCalc --> SevAssigned{Assign<br/>Severity}

    SevAssigned -->|Low| LowSev: 🟢 GREEN
    SevAssigned -->|Medium| MedSev: 🟡 YELLOW
    SevAssigned -->|High| HighSev: 🔴 RED

    LowSev --> PublishAlert: Alert Published<br/>in Feed
    MedSev --> PublishAlert
    HighSev --> PublishAlert

    PublishAlert --> SendNotif: Send Notifications<br/>to All Farmers<br/>in Affected<br/>District

    SendNotif --> CommunityTreats: Community<br/>Discusses<br/>Treatments

    CommunityTreats --> Archived: Status: ARCHIVED<br/>When Disease<br/>Contained

    RejectedState --> [*]
    Archived --> [*]